* ================================================================
* AD4021 : 20-bit, 1 MSPS, SAR ADC (pseudo-differential, SPI)
* Behavioural front-end model: RC input filter, VREF, VDD/VIO
* supplies, CNV conversion clock and SCK read-back clock.
* OUT = analogue reconstruction of the 20-bit output code
*       (i.e. VREF * CODE / 2^20), which is what an ideal DAC
*       driven by the SDO data stream would produce.
* ================================================================

* ---------------- Analogue input (1 V dc) -----------------------
VIN     IN   0    DC 1
* RC kick-back / anti-alias filter into IN+ (R.C ~ 90 ns << 1 us)
R1      IN   INP  33
C1      INP  0    2.7n
* IN- of the pseudo-differential pair returned to ADC ground
RINM    INM  0    1

* ---------------- Reference input (5 V) -------------------------
VREF    REF  0    DC 5
CREF    REF  0    10u          ; low-ESR reference reservoir cap
RREF    REF  REFB 0.1          ; trace/decoupling resistance
CREFB   REFB 0    100n

* ---------------- Supplies --------------------------------------
VDD     VDD  0    DC 1.8       ; analogue core supply
CVDD    VDD  0    100n
VIOS    VIO  0    DC 1.8       ; interface supply
CVIO    VIO  0    100n

* ---------------- Conversion clock : CNV, 1 MSPS ----------------
VCNV    CNV  0    PULSE(0 1.8 100n 1n 1n 40n 1u)
* ---------------- SPI read-back clock : SCK, 50 MHz -------------
VSCK    SCK  0    PULSE(0 1.8 400n 1n 1n 10n 20n)
* SDI held high (3-wire, CS mode)
VSDI    SDI  0    DC 1.8

* ---------------- Track-and-hold (acquire while CNV low) --------
BACQ    ACQ  0    V = 1.8*(V(CNV) < 0.9)
S1      INP  SAMP ACQ 0 SWSAMP
.model SWSAMP SW(Ron=50 Roff=1G Vt=0.9 Vh=0.1)
CH      SAMP 0    20p           ; internal sampling capacitor

* ---------------- 20-bit quantiser (0 .. VREF span) -------------
* Output is valid only when both supplies are up.
BADC    OUT  0    V = (V(VDD)>1.65)*(V(VIO)>1.65)
+ * V(REFB) * floor( limit(V(SAMP),0,V(REFB))/V(REFB)*1048576 + 0.5 ) / 1048576
RLOAD   OUT  0    1Meg

* ---------------- SDO activity flag (busy/data-out) -------------
BSDO    SDO  0    V = V(VIO)*(V(CNV) > 0.9)
RSDO    SDO  0    10k

* ---------------- Analysis --------------------------------------
.tran 0 5u 0 1n
.meas TRAN vout_settled  FIND V(OUT)  AT 4.9u
.meas TRAN vlsb          PARAM 5/1048576
.meas TRAN code_error    PARAM (1 - vout_settled)/vlsb
.options plotwinsize=0
.end
